A '''Joydive''' is a [[Critter]] on [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''Joydives''' spawn in the water of the {{zone|Murkwater Shallows}} and {{zone|Murkwater Depths}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Joydives''' swim around before standing still. If a player throws a [[Fishing Net]] at a '''Joydive''', it will swim into one of {{Green|3}} caves. Only after stopping inside a cave, the '''Joydive''' can take damage from a [[Fishing Net]]. They cannot be damaged from regular damage sources.

'''Joydives''' will start drowning if they spend too long{{More Info Needed|}} underwater, [[mcw:Dolphin#Weaknesses|similar to their vanila counterparts]]. If one dies in this manner, nobody receives shards.

